#                     frames
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/PaintableBox.cpp (lines 994-1349): whether a box has a resizer
#       and its chrome is mirrored, mouse wheel scrolling, hit testing (chrome, children,
#       continuations and the box itself), repaint invalidation, the transform reference box,
#       border radii and outlines, the nearest scroll frame and scrollable ancestor, and the
#       physical resize axes.
